CHECK mode == "refine"

DO Read ticket.md/pr.md together; retain exact saved_pr and preserve unrequested sections.

DO Check branch/HEAD before reusing implementation evidence; inspect committed changes only for
    material gaps and reuse other verified evidence. No target/fetch/readiness pass.

DO Read ../be-human.md; for Description use ../technical-summary.md#summary-content without
    standalone actions.

DO Build in-memory draft from saved_pr, refining only the requested Title line (default
    <TICKET-ID>: <Capitalized action summary>, unless overridden) or Description under Summary
    content. Preserve accurate notes and unrequested sections byte-for-byte; retain unrelated
    gaps for reply. Do not write files yet.

DO Recheck active ticket.md's first heading as current_ticket_id.

CHECK current_ticket_id == ticket_id

DO Save draft only to pr_path.

PRINT with changed path/observed checks, verified PR URL/state or requested explanation,
    blockers/gaps, and partial success; briefly. Keep checklists in chat, preserve pr.md on publish,
    and inspect remote state before uncertain-write retries.
